# Enhanced Liquid Glass Hover Effect

The goal is to improve the "liquid glass" effect on the Benefits section cards on the home page, making it feel more premium, dynamic, and visually striking.

## Proposed Changes

### [MODIFY] [globals.css](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/app/globals.css)

- Refine the `.liquid-glass` class:
    - Add `backdrop-filter: blur(...)` for a true glass look.
    - Improve the `::before` pseudo-element to create a smoother, more "liquid" light effect.
    - Add a subtle border that glows on hover.
    - Use a more complex gradient for the "liquid" reflection.

### [MODIFY] [Benefits.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/sections/Benefits.tsx)

- Update the card styles to ensure they work perfectly with the new CSS.
- Ensure the background is semi-transparent so the `backdrop-filter` is visible.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npm run build` to ensure no CSS or TS issues.

### Manual Verification
- Visual inspection of the Benefits section to verify the "liquid glass" effect on hover.
- Ensure responsiveness and performance (check for lag during hover).
